# GitHub Packages Registry Configuration
# Copy this file to .npmrc and add your GitHub token

@marvinlaubenstein:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN_HERE

# IMPORTANT: 
# 1. Replace YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN_HERE with your actual GitHub token
# 2. Create token at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# 3. Required permissions: read:packages, write:packages
# 4. Add .npmrc to .gitignore!
